   1            /CALCU1 - VERSION 1
   2            
   3            /THIS PROGRAM CAUSES THE PDP-8 TO SIMULATE A PRINTING
   4            /CALCULATOR, CAPABLE OF ADDITION, SUBTRACTION,
   5            /MULTIPLICATION, DIVISION, AND EXPONENTIATION.
   6            /SUBTOTALS AND TOTALS ARE PRODUCED ON COMMAND.
   7            /AN INITIAL DIALOG GIVES ESSENTIAL OPERATING IN-
   8            /STRUCTIONS.
   9            
  10            /THIS PROGRAM IS DESIGNED TO UTILIZE ONE OF THE DEC
  11            /FLOATING POINT PACKAGES.  THE BINARY FOR THE
  12            /APPROPRIATE FLOATING POINT PACKAGE (EAE, NONEAE, 27-BIT)
  13            /MUST BE LOADED WITH THE BINARY ASSEMBLED FROM
  14            /THIS SOURCE PROGRAM OR RESULTS WILL BE UNPREDICTABLE.
  15            
  16            /FPP PSEUDO-INSTRUCTIONS:
  17            
  18                    FIXMRI  FADD=1000
  19                    FIXMRI  FSUB=2000
  20                    FIXMRI  FMPY=3000
  21                    FIXMRI  FDIV=4000
  22                    FIXMRI  FGET=5000
  23                    FIXMRI  FPUT=6000
